    <string name="about_feature_2">ለKITSRUS P018 ፕሮቶኮሎች (K150, K128, K149, K182) ድጋፍ.</string>
    <string name="about_feature_3">ሊታወቅ የሚችል የቁስ ንድፍ በይነገጽ።</string>
    <string name="about_feature_4">ለ arm64-v8a፣ armeabi-v7a፣ x86 እና x86_64 አርክቴክቸር ድጋፍ።</string>
